### =====================================================
### EMPRESAS
### =====================================================

### Criar Empresa Alpha
POST http://localhost:8080/api/companies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cnpj": "12.345.678/0001-90",
  "name": "Empresa Alpha",
  "email": "admin@alpha.com",
  "password": "123456",
  "phone": "11999999999"
}

###

### Criar Empresa Beta
POST http://localhost:8080/api/companies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cnpj": "98.765.432/0001-10",
  "name": "Empresa Beta",
  "email": "admin@beta.com",
  "password": "123456",
  "phone": "11988887777"
}

### LOGIN EMPRESA ALPHA
POST http://localhost:8080/api/companies/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@alpha.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### LOGIN EMPRESA BETA
POST http://localhost:8080/api/companies/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@beta.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### LOGOUT
POST http://localhost:8080/api/companies/logout
Content-Type: application/json

