### =====================================================
### DESCARTES DE MATERIAL (DiscardMaterialRequestDTO)
### =====================================================

### Criar Descarte - João (TI - Alpha)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/discard-materials
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: JSESSIONID=1047B253EA54B5D54B89014C73BB3893

{
  "type": "REUSE", 
  "description": "Descarte de mouses e teclados antigos que pararam de funcionar.",
  "discardDate": "2026-09-12T14:30:00",
  "weight": 5.5,
  "userId": 1,
  "status": "PENDING",
  "departmentId": 1
}

### Criar Descarte - Maria (RH - Alpha)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/discards
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: JSESSIONID=COLOQUE_AQUI_O_COOKIE_DA_MARIA

{
  "type": "RECYCLING", 
  "description": "Descarte de arquivos antigos e caixas de papelão.",
  "discardDate": "2026-09-13T09:15:00",
  "weight": 12.0,
  "userId": 2,
  "status": "APROVED",
  "departmentId": 2
}


### =====================================================
### HISTÓRICO DE STATUS (DiscardMaterialStatusHistoryRequestDTO)
### =====================================================

### Atualizar Status do Descarte (Exemplo para o Descarte de ID 1)
# O método pode ser PATCH ou POST dependendo do seu Controller
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/discard-materials/1/status
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: JSESSIONID=1047B253EA54B5D54B89014C73BB3893

{
  "status": "COMPLETED"
}


